QSort - (c) 1991 Michael D. G.

QSort is a simple yet fast sort program.

SYNTAX:

     To File         Upper/Lower        Descending Order
      |               |                  |
FROM,TO,COLSTART/K/N,CASE/S,NUMERIC/S,DESCEND/S
 |          |      |          |
From File  Starting Column   Numeric Sort
